OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FWednesday will be dry and
OL,6,Fsettled with some hot sunshine
OL,7,Fdeveloping, once any early patches of
OL,8,Fmist clear. Some cloud will edge in
OL,9,Ffrom the northwest during the day,
OL,10,Fjust turning the sunshine a little
OL,11,Fhazy in places.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FThere'll be hot sunshine to
OL,14,Fend the day, and clear spells this
OL,15,Fevening. However, cloud will gradually
OL,16,Fincrease from the northwest overnight
OL,17,Fperhaps with an isolated shower
OL,18,Fbreaking out later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,168,160,301,260,100,100
