OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FThere will be a fair amount
OL,6,Fof cloud around on Thursday morning,
OL,7,Fwith a small chance of a shower. Skies
OL,8,Fwill brighten from the north into the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Feeling fresher.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FIt looks
OL,12,Flargely dry on Friday and during the
OL,13,Fweekend. Though remaining a little
OL,14,Fcooler and fresher there will be some
OL,15,Fwarm spells of sunshine at times, with
OL,16,Fgentle winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
